(7592473, 1224039, 30049, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Ja-9:</b></div><hr/><i> Good for you!!!  Is this from your trip too? </i></td></tr></table> <br/>:-) Nope.  Took this down by the pond on our property.  The highlights are from water sparkles in the background, the green is from tall grass that grows at the waters edge.  Always get some grass in the field that goes to seed head before we mow ... just had to pick the right one / angle, etc...  A hat''s off to my DPL teammates too as I had several choices to pick from ... the majority ruled on this one.  :-D<br/> <br/>BTW - If I haven''t mentioned it in a while, I absolutely love, Love, LOVE this lens.  Best $50 I''ve ever spent!</td>', 'Originally posted by Ja-9: Good for you!!!  Is this from your trip too?  :-) Nope.  Took this down by the pond on our property.  The highlights are from water sparkles in the background, the green is from tall grass that grows at the waters edge.  Always get some grass in the field that goes to seed head before we mow ... just had to pick the right one / angle, etc...  A hat''s off to my DPL teammates too as I had several choices to pick from ... the majority ruled on this one.  :-D BTW - If I haven''t mentioned it in a while, I absolutely love, Love, LOVE this lens.  Best $50 I''ve ever spent!', '2018-08-15 17:29:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(7592500, 1224314, 86447, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp and good bokeh!   And I love your back story on the "outtakes" page!<br/> <br/>Well done!<br/> <br/>Such dedication!<br/></td>', 'Nice and sharp and good bokeh!   And I love your back story on the "outtakes" page! Well done! Such dedication!', '2018-08-15 20:28:11.000000', NULL, 0),
