(7592544, 1224203, 114285, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by orvaratli:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Neat:</b></div><hr/><i> Id love to see these creatures one day, knew this would win. A big congrats.<br/> <br/>Btw how long do they keep the fishies in their mouths before they eat them? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks!<br/>Easy enough to see them here in Iceland. They do not eat the fish themselves, they are bringing it in for their chicks which are in borrows in the grass. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>What good parents ;)<br/> <br/>Thanks.</td>', 'Originally posted by orvaratli: Originally posted by Neat: Id love to see these creatures one day, knew this would win. A big congrats. Btw how long do they keep the fishies in their mouths before they eat them?   Thanks!Easy enough to see them here in Iceland. They do not eat the fish themselves, they are bringing it in for their chicks which are in borrows in the grass.   What good parents ;) Thanks.', '2018-08-16 03:21:48.000000', NULL, 0),
